Lesson 2 — Search & Redirection
Command	Purpose
find	Search for files
grep	Search text inside files
>	Overwrite output to a file
>>	Append output to a file
cat	Display file contents
rmdir	Remove an empty directory
Important Concepts
Absolute path: Starts from the root (e.g. /f/Scripts/SQL).
Relative path: Starts from the current directory (e.g. cd SQL).
find searches for files and folders.
grep searches for matching text.